    "Put's wait-queue handoff sends on req while holding c.mu; concurrently a Get in the select branch could be trying c.mu.Lock in default. Is the lock ordering safe against blocking, given the request channel has buffer 1?",
    "In Get's default branch, c.factory() is invoked while mu is held; arbitrary factory work blocks all Put/Close/Release. Is that intended?",
